sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant PG as Products.jsx
  participant URL as URL query string
  participant UA as useAsync hook
  participant PS as productService.js
  participant BE as routers/products.py
  participant DB as SQLite
  U->>PG: tick a filter or change the sort
  PG->>URL: setSearchParams (q, category, brand, max, rating, sort)
  URL-->>PG: re-render with the parsed filters
  PG->>UA: useAsync(getProducts, deps = URL)
  UA->>PS: call (loading = true)
  PS->>BE: GET /api/products?category=..&sort=..
  BE->>BE: build WHERE conditions (parameterised, injection-safe)
  BE->>DB: SELECT ... ORDER BY ... LIMIT
  DB-->>BE: rows
  BE-->>PS: ProductOut list as camelCase JSON
  PS-->>UA: data
  UA-->>PG: data, loading = false
  PG-->>U: product grid renders
  Note over UA: If the filters change mid-request, the old response is ignored
